OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after masked burglars raid
OL,4,Aseveral homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of break-ins believed to have
OL,7,Fbeen carried out by balaclava-clad
OL,8,Fburglars has caused "thousands of
OL,9,Fpounds worth of damage", a councillor
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FIn footage shared online, perpetrators
OL,13,Fcan be seen targeting homes in Myrtle
OL,14,FClose, Myrtle Drive and Myrtle Crescent
OL,15,Fin Sheffield, before making off on
OL,16,Fbikes or on foot.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
