OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after masked burglars raid
OL,4,Aseveral homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Miskell, councillor for Park and
OL,7,FArbourthorne, has called for increased
OL,8,Fpolice patrols, adding: "People should
OL,9,Fbe able to feel safe in their own
OL,10,Fhomes. What residents have experienced
OL,11,Fhere is completely unacceptable."
OL,13,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it was
OL,14,Faware of a rise in reported burglaries
OL,15,Fin the area and that officers would
OL,16,Fprovide "a visible presence".
